WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.572
Tomorrow, I’m going to a garage sale.

2
00:00:04.573 --> 00:00:07.934
Do you know what a garage sale is?

3
00:00:07.935 --> 00:00:12.346
Why don’t you come with me?

4
00:00:12.347 --> 00:00:15.284
Hana: What are we doing tomorrow?

5
00:00:15.285 --> 00:00:18.441
Sunny: We’re going to a garage sale.

6
00:00:18.442 --> 00:00:20.378
Bada: What’s that?

7
00:00:20.379 --> 00:00:24.298
Mom: Let’s find out.

8
00:00:24.299 --> 00:00:32.479
Sunny: At garage sales, people sell things they don’t need or want

9
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.452
anymore. Mom: How much is

10
00:00:34.453 --> 00:00:39.250
this? Woman: Oh, that’s fifty

11
00:00:39.251 --> 00:00:41.192
cents. Hana: What’s

12
00:00:41.193 --> 00:00:45.233
that? Woman: That’s a record player.

13
00:00:45.234 --> 00:00:52.418
Listen. Hana & Bada: Wow! What are

14
00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:54.753
these? Woman: These are cookie

15
00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:57.944
cutters. You can make cookies in these shapes.

16
00:00:57.945 --> 00:01:00.198
Hana: How much are they?

17
00:01:00.199 --> 00:01:03.451
Woman: Ten cents each.

18
00:01:03.452 --> 00:01:05.783
Bada: I like this!

19
00:01:05.784 --> 00:01:08.268
Woman: It used to be my son’s.

20
00:01:08.269 --> 00:01:10.670
You can have it for free! Bada:

21
00:01:10.671 --> 00:01:13.071
Thank you very much! Woman

22
00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:16.123
: You’re welcome!

23
00:01:16.124 --> 00:01:19.035
Bada: Look what she gave me!

24
00:01:19.036 --> 00:01:20.982
Hana: Look what I got!

25
00:01:20.983 --> 00:01:25.610
Mom: Oh, you can make cookies now.

26
00:01:25.611 --> 00:01:30.509
In America, people don’t just throw away things.

27
00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:32.996
Other people may want them.

28
00:01:32.997 --> 00:01:36.660
Instead, they have garage sales.

29
00:01:36.661 --> 00:01:46.059
Garage sales are lots of fun!

